\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Key configurations and outcomes. NVE reports peak $\mathrm  {nve}$ in the 35K+ window (\S  \ref {sec:metrics}). CIVO-positive seeds are shaded. Abbreviations: trn = trained ($d{=}32$, subsample ON); exp$^a$ = trained, subsample OFF; frz$^b$ = frozen ($d{=}32$, \texttt  {requires\_grad=False}); --- = removed ($d{=}0$). $^c$~Environment-specific baseline. $^d$~Frozen control matches; environment-specific. $^e$~Seed-dependent (Table~\ref {tab:cross_domain}). $^f$~Corrected-code rerun (Appendix~\ref {sec:code_corrections}). $^g$~NVE median [range $0.31$--$127.6\times $]; mean$\pm $std dominated by outlier seed. Multi-seed entries report mean$\pm $std ($n$ noted in Config column). NVE reference baselines: Walker s1 (915.7); Cheetah $446.1$. Complete results for all 58 configurations in Table~\ref {tab:complete_results}.}}{5}{table.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
