\newlabel{fig:temporal_ordering}{{3}{6}{Temporal ordering of fidelity degradation and value overestimation (exp\_066, seed~0). \textbf {Left axis}: single-step fidelity ratio (blue) grows from $1.05\times $ to $1.68\times $. \textbf {Right axis}: value-to-eval ratio (red) remains near zero until 40K, then spikes. The ${\sim }$10K lag supports the causal direction: fidelity gap $\to $ value overestimation}{figure.caption.16}{}}
