\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces CIVO decomposition: peak and final (105K step) evaluation returns on Walker Walk across four conditions. \textbf  {Baseline} (001): vanilla DreamerV3. \textbf  {Trained dt-emb} (008d)\footnotemark : learned $d{=}32$ temporal embedding with multi-rate data. \textbf  {Full-SGS} (s1, s2): trained embedding with all non-KL gradients detached from $e_{\mathrm  {dt}}$. Trained $\mathrm  {dt}$-embedding degrades peak eval by $73\%$ and final eval by $86\%$. Full-SGS seed~1 shows partial mitigation ($-51\%$ final, NVE $1.66\times $, still CIVO-positive) while seed~2 collapses ($-96\%$ final). CIVO elimination rate $= 0/2$.}}{26}{figure.caption.79}\protected@file@percent }
