\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {20}{\ignorespaces RSSM fidelity analysis on Walker Walk (training-time posterior-conditioned, pre-v3 standardization). Reward prediction gap magnitude varies across checkpoints and measurement protocols: this posterior-conditioned analysis yields $3.11\times $, while v3 standardized analysis (Table~\ref {tab:rssm_fidelity}) yields $1.63\times $. The qualitative pattern, that the trained embedding amplifies the reward gap while improving observation reconstruction, is consistent across both.}}{42}{table.caption.69}\protected@file@percent }
